c":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 0.2%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $1,565M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 63.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 4.03"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":89.78,"default_fair_val":89.78,"premium_pct":91.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":668.5,"pe_forward":588.3,"pb_trailing":4,"pb_forward":3.6,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":6.64,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":63,"cash_to_assets":28.8,"current_ratio":4.03,"roe":0.6,"roa":0.2,"moat":{"ticker":"NBIS","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 在其軟體應用領域展現了不錯的定價權，這主要歸功於其產品的專業性和針對特定客戶群的解決方案。雖然不像消費品牌那樣擁有廣泛的消費者認知，但其在企業級市場的專業聲譽和客戶黏性，使其能夠維持相對穩定的價格。然而，與頂級軟體巨頭相比，其品牌影響力仍有提升空間，這限制了其進一步的定價能力。","comment_en":"Nebius Group demonstrates decent pricing power within its software application niche, primarily driven by product specialization and tailored solutions for specific client segments. While not possessing the broad consumer recognition of household brands, its professional reputation and customer stickiness in the enterprise market allow for relatively stable pricing. However, compared to top-tier software giants, its brand influence has room for growth, which caps its ability to command premium pricing further."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"作為一家軟體公司，Nebius Group 可能擁有其核心技術的專利保護，這在一定程度上構成了進入壁壘。然而，軟體領域的技術迭代速度快，專利保護的時效性和有效性可能不如實體產業。監管環境對其影響相對較小，除非涉及數據隱私或特定行業合規要求。總體而言，專利提供了基礎保護，但並非絕對的、長期的護城河。","comment_en":"As a software company, Nebius Group likely benefits from patent protection on its core technologies, providing a degree of barrier to entry. However, the rapid pace of technological evolution in software means patent protection may have limited longevity and effectiveness compared to industries with physical assets. Regulatory impact is relatively minor unless specific data privacy or industry compliance issues arise. Overall, patents offer foundational protection but are not an absolute, long-term moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 的軟體產品，特別是針對企業客戶的解決方案，通常伴隨著較高的轉換成本。這包括了數據遷移的複雜性、員工的培訓時間、以及與現有工作流程整合的難度。一旦客戶深度採用並依賴其系統，更換供應商將會耗費大量時間、金錢和潛在的業務中斷風險，這為 Nebius Group 築起了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Nebius Group's software solutions, particularly those tailored for enterprise clients, typically entail significant switching costs. These include the complexity of data migration, employee training requirements, and the integration challenges with existing workflows. Once customers become deeply embedded and reliant on its systems, the cost, time, and potential business disruption associated with changing vendors create a robust moat for Nebius Group."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 的網絡效應可能體現在其平台的協作功能或數據共享方面，尤其是在企業客戶之間。如果其軟體促進了客戶間的互動或數據交換，那麼用戶數量的增加會提升產品的價值。然而，這種效應的強度取決於其產品的具體應用場景，可能不如社交媒體或市場平台那樣顯著。需要進一步評估其平台生態的活躍度和用戶依賴度。","comment_en":"Network effects for Nebius Group might manifest in platform collaboration features or data-sharing capabilities, especially among its enterprise clientele. If its software facilitates inter-customer interaction or data exchange, an increasing user base would enhance the product's value. However, the strength of this effect is contingent on the specific use cases of its software and may not be as pronounced as in social media or marketplace platforms. Further assessment of its platform ecosystem's activity and user dependency is needed."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家軟體公司，Nebius Group 的規模經濟效益主要體現在研發攤銷和營銷推廣成本上。隨著用戶基礎的擴大，邊際獲取新客戶的成本相對較低，且研發投入可以被更多的用戶分攤，從而降低單位成本。其龐大的現金儲備也支持其在規模擴張和技術投入上保持優勢，使其在成本控制方面具有一定的競爭力。","comment_en":"As a software company, Nebius Group's economies of scale are primarily realized in the amortization of R&D expenses and marketing costs. With an expanding user base, the marginal cost of acquiring new customers is relatively low, and R&D investments can be spread across more users, reducing per-unit costs. Its substantial cash reserves also support its scale expansion and technology investments, giving it a competitive cost advantage."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 作為一家科技軟體公司，其業務模式通常不依賴於獨特的地理位置或實體資產。其價值主要體現在知識產權、技術能力和客戶關係上，這些可以在全球範圍內複製和擴展。因此，在這一維度上，其護城河相對較弱，不具備顯著的地理或資產壁壘。","comment_en":"Nebius Group, as a technology software company, typically does not rely on unique geographic locations or physical assets for its business model. Its value resides primarily in intellectual property, technical capabilities, and customer relationships, which are replicable and scalable globally. Consequently, its moat in this dimension is relatively weak, lacking significant geographical or asset-based barriers."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 的營運效率體現在其穩健的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $1,564.7M）和相對健康的資產負債表（現金充足，負債可控）。這表明公司能夠有效地將收入轉化為現金，並有效管理其營運成本。雖然 ROE 和 ROA 指標相對較低（0.6% 和 0.2%），這可能與其處於成長階段或高研發投入有關，但其強勁的現金流生成能力是營運效率的有力證明。","comment_en":"Nebius Group's operational efficiency is evident in its robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $1,564.7M) and a relatively healthy balance sheet with ample cash and manageable debt. This indicates the company's ability to effectively convert revenue into cash and manage operational costs. While ROE and ROA are relatively low (0.6% and 0.2%), possibly due to its growth phase or high R&D investments, its strong cash generation capability is a testament to its operational effectiveness."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 擁有充足的現金儲備（$8,042.1M）和相對較低的負債水平，這為其提供了靈活的資本配置能力。公司可以選擇通過研發投入、戰略收購、股票回購或股息支付來優化股東回報。其強勁的自由現金流也支持了持續的投資和潛在的擴張。管理層若能持續做出明智的資本配置決策，將是其長期價值的關鍵。","comment_en":"Nebius Group possesses substantial cash reserves ($8,042.1M) and a relatively low debt level, affording it significant flexibility in capital allocation. The company can strategically deploy capital through R&D investments, acquisitions, share buybacks, or dividend payments to enhance shareholder returns. Its strong free cash flow generation further supports ongoing investments and potential expansion. Prudent and consistent capital allocation decisions by management will be crucial for its long-term value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 的高轉換成本（M3）直接促進了客戶的留存率。一旦企業客戶將其業務流程深度整合到 Nebius 的軟體中，並進行了相應的培訓和數據遷移，他們通常會傾向於長期使用該服務以避免中斷和額外成本。這種黏性使得客戶流失率較低，為公司提供了穩定的收入基礎。","comment_en":"Nebius Group's high switching costs (M3) directly contribute to strong customer retention. Once enterprise clients deeply integrate their business processes with Nebius's software, having invested in training and data migration, they are inclined to continue using the service long-term to avoid disruption and additional expenses. This stickiness results in a low churn rate, providing a stable revenue base for the company."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Nebius Group 的護城河具有一定的持久性，主要來自於其軟體產品的高轉換成本和客戶黏性。雖然技術變革是軟體行業的常態，但其建立的客戶關係和嵌入式系統為其提供了相對穩定的市場地位。只要公司能持續投入研發以保持技術領先，並維持其營運效率和資本配置能力，其競爭優勢有望在較長時期內保持。","comment_en":"Nebius Group's moat possesses a degree of durability, primarily stemming from the high switching costs and customer stickiness associated with its software products. While technological change is constant in the software industry, the established customer relationships and embedded systems provide a relatively stable market position. As long as the company continues to invest in R&D to maintain technological leadership and sustains its operational efficiency and capital allocation capabilities, its competitive advantages are likely to endure over a considerable period."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Nebius Group 的護城河主要體現為一種「收費橋」模式，其核心在於高昂的客戶轉換成本和深度整合的解決方案，使得企業客戶難以輕易更換供應商。這種黏性為公司帶來了穩定的收入流和較高的客戶留存率。雖然其品牌影響力與頂級科技公司尚有差距，且專利壁壘並非絕對，但其在特定企業級市場的專業聲譽和規模經濟效益，共同構建了一個相對堅固的競爭壁壘。強勁的自由現金流和充裕的現金儲備，也為其持續的研發投入和潛在的戰略佈局提供了有力支持，使其在科技軟體領域具備長期投資價值。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Nebius Group's moat primarily functions as a 'toll bridge' model, built upon high customer switching costs and deeply integrated solutions that make it difficult for enterprise clients to change vendors easily. This stickiness provides the company with stable revenue streams and high customer retention. While its brand influence may not match top-tier tech giants and patent barriers are not absolute, its professional reputation in specific enterprise markets and economies of scale collectively form a relatively robust competitive barrier. Strong free cash flow and ample cash reserves also support continuous R&D investment and potential strategic expansion, positioning it as a long-term investment prospect in the technology software sector.","evidenceHash":"d90dc152e3b722faeb7f01544c6dfc9234f5338d1e8609e901167bb0aad2d19b","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"b118f00dbf5496e0e28100df3342ad97428220496df3758054defb152064569e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"b118f00dbf5496e0e28100df3342ad97428220496df3758054defb152064569e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NBIS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NBIS.png","website":"https://nebius.com/company","ceo":"Arkady Volozh","full_time_employees":"1543","description":"Nebius Group N.V. is a technology company dedicated to developing comprehensive infrastructure to serve the global artificial intelligence industry. Its operations encompass several key areas. Central to its mission is Nebius, an AI-focused cloud platform engineered to handle demanding AI workloads. This division constructs end-to-end AI infrastructure, featuring extensive GPU computing clusters, robust cloud platforms, and essential tools and services for developers. The group also includes Toloka AI, which functions as a data solutions provider, assisting with various phases of generative AI development. TripleTen operates as an educational technology venture, focused on equipping individuals with new skills for careers in the tech sector. Furthermore, Avride specializes in pioneering autonomous driving technologies for self-driving vehicles and delivery robots. Founded in 1989, the company was previously known as Yandex N.V. until its rebranding to Nebius Group N.V. in August 2024. Its headquarters are located in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, with additional research and development facilities spread across Europe, North America, and Israel.","description_en":"Nebius Group N.V. is a technology company dedicated to developing comprehensive infrastructure to serve the global artificial intelligence industry. Its operations encompass several key areas. Central to its mission is Nebius, an AI-focused cloud platform engineered to handle demanding AI workloads. This division constructs end-to-end AI infrastructure, featuring extensive GPU computing clusters, robust cloud platforms, and essential tools and services for developers. The group also includes Toloka AI, which functions as a data solutions provider, assisting with various phases of generative AI development. TripleTen operates as an educational technology venture, focused on equipping individuals with new skills for careers in the tech sector. Furthermore, Avride specializes in pioneering autonomous driving technologies for self-driving vehicles and delivery robots. Founded in 1989, the company was previously known as Yandex N.V. until its rebranding to Nebius Group N.V. in August 2024. Its headquarters are located in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, with additional research and development facilities spread across Europe, North America, and Israel.","description_zh":"**Nebius Group N.V. (NBIS) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nNebius Group N.V. 是一家專注於建構全球人工智慧 (AI) 產業所需之全面性基礎設施的科技公司。其核心業務涵蓋多個關鍵領域：\n\n*   **Nebius 雲端平台：** 提供專為 AI 工作負載設計的雲端基礎設施，包含大規模 GPU 計算集群、穩健的雲端平台，以及開發者所需的工具與服務，支援端對端 AI 專案開發。\n*   **Toloka AI：** 作為資料解決方案供應商，協助客戶完成生成式 AI 開發的各個階段，提供數據標註、模型驗證等服務。\n*   **TripleTen 教育科技：** 透過線上教育平台，為個人提供科技產業的職能培訓與技能提升，協助其進入新興科技領域。\n*   **Avride 自動駕駛技術：** 專精於為自駕車與物流機器人開發先進的自動駕駛技術。\n\n該公司前身為 Yandex N.V.，於 2024 年 8 月更名為 Nebius Group N.V.。總部位於荷蘭阿姆斯特丹，並於歐洲、北美及以色列設有研發據點。","address":"Schiphol Boulevard 165","city":"Schiphol","state":null,"zip":"1118 BG","country":"NL","phone":"31 202 066 970","full_address":"Schiphol Boulevard 165, Schiphol, None 1118 BG, NL","range_52w":"73.52-299.86","year_high":299.86,"year_low":73.52,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":73.52,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Grimme Arne","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":148,"price":167.94,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Grimme Arne","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":151,"price":164.62,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-10-20","name":"Grimme Arne","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":148,"price":169.99,"total_val":0.03},{"date":"2026-10-19","name":"Boynton John Wilson IV","title":"director","is_buy":f